0026 interest database\\n  - Cron job untuk tugas berkala\\n  - Public pendeta profile page\\n  - CV/Resume report generation\\n- **Depends**: `hr`, `church_base`, `mail`, `website`\\n\\n### 4. `church_management_komisi_member` — Keanggotaan Komisi\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Pengelolaan keanggotaan komisi/bidang dengan consent dan approval\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Pendaftaran anggota ke komisi (invite, self-enroll, admin wizard)\\n  - Status workflow: `draft → pending → active → alumni`\\n  - Pengajuan perubahan data (change request) dengan approval\\n  - Konfigurasi visibilitas field per komisi\\n  - Batch enrollment \\u0026 graduation wizard\\n  - Community Manager group\\n  - Jabatan management\\n- **Depends**: `church_management_base`, `mail`\\n\\n### 5. `church_management_bursapelayanan` — Bursa Pelayanan\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Marketplace pelayanan jemaat — matching kebutuhan pelayanan dengan ketersediaan anggota\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Publikasi lowongan pelayanan\\n  - Registrasi \\u0026 pendaftaran pelayanan\\n  - Template registrasi online\\n- **Depends**: `base`, `church_management_base`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## C. Modul Keuangan \\u0026 Program\\n\\n### 6. `church_program` — Rencana Kerja Anggaran (RKA)\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Perencanaan program kerja dan anggaran tahunan\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Program kerja per periode\\n  - Anggaran per bidang/komisi\\n  - Bank statement management\\n  - Budget reference\\n  - Fiscal year management\\n  - Komisi Year (program kerja per komisi per tahun)\\n  - Init Program Wizard (setup awal)\\n  - Visi \\u0026 Misi management\\n  - Public visi/misi page\\n  - Public program page\\n  - Program dashboard (OWL)\\n  - Program \\u0026 Komisi Year report PDF\\n  - Event integration\\n  - Documentation templates\\n- **Depends**: `base`, `church_base`, `uom`, `account`, `account_edi`, `account_fiscal_year`, `account_statement_base`, `event`, `report_qr`, `website`\\n\\n### 7. `church_program_evaluation` — Evaluasi Program Kerja\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Sistem evaluasi terhadap program kerja tahunan\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Evaluasi per fiscal year\\n  - Pertanyaan evaluasi (kuesioner)\\n  - Jawaban evaluasi\\n  - Evaluasi bulanan\\n  - Bank statement approval\\n  - Komisi year evaluation report\\n  - Public evaluation \\u0026 dashboard page\\n  - OWL evaluation dashboard (backend)\\n- **Depends**: `church_base`, `church_program`, `survey`, `website`\\n\\n### 8. `church_accounting` — Church Accounting Bank Import\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.1.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Import bank statement dari berbagai format\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Import CSV, PDF, HTML bank statements\\n  - Dynamic import scripts/config\\n  - Bank statement tagging\\n  - Account asset group data\\n  - Statement import wizard\\n- **Depends**: `account`, `account_statement_base`, `account_asset_management`, `church_base`\\n\\n### 9. `church_management_crowdfunding` — Crowdfunding\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Sistem donasi dan crowdfunding gereja\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Campaign management\\n  - Invoice generation untuk donasi\\n  - Email notification donatur\\n  - Public crowdfunding page\\n- **Depends**: `base`, `account`, `church_management_base`, `mail`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## D. Modul Evaluasi \\u0026 Dashboard\\n\\n### 10. `church_evaluation` — Church Evaluation\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.3.2.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Sistem evaluasi berbasis pengukuran (measures) untuk PURJ\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Jemaat Measure (indikator pengukuran)\\n  - Jemaat Measure Value (nilai pengukuran per tahun)\\n  - Jemaat Fiscalyear Evaluation\\n  - Evaluation Dashboard\\n  - Jemaat Portal Views\\n  - Klasis Evaluation \\u0026 Narrative\\n  - Sinode Wilayah Evaluation \\u0026 Section\\n  - Slide documentation\\n  - Litbang security groups (multi-tier)\\n  - Force close wizard\\n  - JSON table edit wizard\\n  - Fiscal year configuration\\n- **Depends**: `account`, `portal`, `mail`, `account_fiscal_year`, `church_base`, `mgmtsystem_evaluation`\\n\\n### 11. `church_dashboard` — Church Dashboard (BI)\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Self-service BI dashboard untuk visualisasi data evaluasi\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Configurable dashboard with multiple chart items\\n  - Tipe chart: Bar, Line, Pie, Doughnut, Radar, KPI Cards\\n  - Multi-level data: Jemaat, Klasis, Sinode Wilayah\\n  - Fiscal year comparison\\n  - Server-side aggregation (read_group)\\n  - OWL frontend + Chart.js 4.x\\n- **Depends**: `base`, `web`, `church_base`, `church_evaluation`\\n\\n### 12. `church_dashboard_builder` — Dashboard Builder\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Custom chart builder dari measure values\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Chart custom: bar, line, pie, doughnut, combo, dll\\n  - Drag \\u0026 drop layout\\n  - Template yang bisa di-reuse\\n  - Berbagi dashboard antar pengguna\\n  - Dashboard security groups\\n- **Depends**: `church_evaluation`, `church_base`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## E. Modul Ibadah \\u0026 Konten\\n\\n### 13. `church_management_worshipplan` — Worship Planner\\n- **Versi**: 16.0 (dari migrasi)\\n- **Deskripsi**: Perencanaan dan penjadwalan ibadah\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Tata ibadah (liturgi)\\n  - Penjadwalan pelayan ibadah\\n  - Integrasi dengan event\\n- **Depends**: (dari modul legacy)\\n\\n### 14. `church_management_worshipplan_data` — Worship Planner Data\\n- **Deskripsi**: Data master untuk worship planner\\n\\n### 15. `church_management_worshipplan_data_scripture` — Scripture Data\\n- **Deskripsi**: Database pembacaan Alkitab untuk ibadah\\n\\n### 16. `church_management_worshipplan_data_song` — Song Data\\n- **Deskripsi**: Database lagu-lagu untuk ibadah\\n\\n### 17. `church_management_worshipplan_media` — Worship Plan Media\\n- **Deskripsi**: Manajemen media (slide, video) untuk ibadah\\n\\n### 18. `church_management_song_melody` — Song Melody Fingerprinting\\n- **Versi**: 16.0 (dari migrasi)\\n- **Deskripsi**: Database lagu dengan fingerprinting melodi\\n\\n### 19. `church_management_renungan` — Renungan\\n- **Deskripsi**: Manajemen konten renungan harian\\n\\n### 20. `church_management_navidrome` — Navidrome Integration\\n- **Deskripsi**: Integrasi dengan Navidrome music server untuk audio streaming\\n\\n---\\n\\n## F. Modul Event \\u0026 Presensi\\n\\n### 21. `church_management_event` — Event Management\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Manajemen event dan kegiatan gereja\\n\\n### 22. `church_management_presensi` — Presensi\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Sistem presensi/kehadiran jemaat\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Data ruangan\\n  - Data kegiatan \\u0026 jadwal kegiatan\\n  - Presensi anggota per kegiatan\\n  - Checkpoint system\\n  - Integrasi worship service \\u0026 worship plan event\\n  - Event booking integration\\n- **Depends**: `base`, `church_management_base`, `church_management_worshipplan`, `event`, `event_booking`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## G. Modul Aset \\u0026 Fasilitas\\n\\n### 23. `church_asset` — Church Asset\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Pencatatan dan pengelolaan aset/inventaris per jemaat\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Kategorisasi aset (gedung, kendaraan, peralatan ibadah, dll)\\n  - Pencatatan detail aset\\n  - Pengelompokan aset per jemaat\\n  - Tracking kondisi \\u0026 status aset\\n  - Land shape map (peta bidang tanah)\\n  - Geo-computation (shapely, pyproj)\\n  - Asset security per jemaat\\n- **Depends**: `church_base`, `church_hr`, `account_asset_management`, `mail`\\n\\n### 24. `church_room` — Church Room Management\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Manajemen ruangan gereja\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Pencatatan ruangan \\u0026 fasilitas\\n  - Peminjaman/reservasi ruangan dengan workflow approval\\n  - Tracking lokasi aset di setiap ruangan\\n  - Calendar view jadwal pemakaian\\n  - Fasilitas master data\\n- **Depends**: `account_asset_management`, `church_accounting`, `mail`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## H. Modul Autentikasi \\u0026 Keamanan\\n\\n### 25. `auth_passkey` — Passkey Authentication\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: WebAuthn/Passkey authentication untuk passwordless login\\n\\n### 26. `auth_brute_force` — Auth Brute Force Protection\\n- **Deskripsi**: Proteksi brute-force login\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Tracking failed login attempts per IP \\u0026 username\\n  - Auto-block setelah threshold\\n\\n### 27. `church_auth_bridge` — Auth Bridge\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Cross-authenticate dari CMS (Odoo 12) ke RKA (Odoo 16)\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Remote authentication via JSON-RPC\\n  - Auto-create local user\\n  - Email/login matching\\n  - Password sync\\n  - Configurable remote server URL\\n\\n### 28. `church_device_auth` — Device Authentication\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Login untuk TV \\u0026 Smart Display menggunakan kode pairing\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - 6-digit pairing code + QR code\\n  - Support: Android TV, Apple TV, Fire TV, Smart Display\\n  - OAuth 2.0 Device Authorization Grant (RFC 8628)\\n  - Cron auto-cleanup expired codes\\n\\n### 29. `admin_user_impersonate` — Admin Impersonate\\n- **Deskripsi**: Fitur impersonasi user untuk admin (debugging/support)\\n\\n### 30. `church_management_auth_signup` — Registrasi\\n- **Deskripsi**: Custom signup/registration flow untuk jemaat\\n\\n---\\n\\n## I. Modul Portal \\u0026 Komunikasi\\n\\n### 31. `church_portal` — Church Portal\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.1\\n- **Deskripsi**: Portal access untuk GKI.ONE web app\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Portal user read access ke announcements\\n  - Portal user read access ke jemaat models\\n  - JSON-RPC authentication for portal\\n  - Jemaat admin-only filtering\\n  - Portal menu hiding (simplified portal)\\n  - Grouped portal home\\n\\n### 32. `church_crm` — Church CRM - Pelayanan Jemaat\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Manajemen kunjungan pastoral dan feedback jemaat\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Perencanaan \\u0026 penjadwalan kunjungan pastoral\\n  - Pencatatan hasil kunjungan \\u0026 tindak lanjut\\n  - Manajemen tim pelawatan\\n  - Kategori jenis kunjungan\\n  - Pencatatan alasan kegagalan kunjungan\\n  - Tracking hadiah/kenang-kenangan\\n  - GPS lokasi kunjungan\\n  - Waktu mulai/selesai kunjungan\\n  - Integrasi data pergumulan\\n  - Pengingat via Telegram\\n  - Feedback jemaat (masukan, saran, kritik, apresiasi)\\n  - Kategorisasi feedback berdasarkan topik\\n\\n### 33. `sms_gateway_client` — SMS Gateway\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Integrasi SMS gateway untuk pengiriman pesan\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - SMS compose wizard\\n  - SMS tracking\\n  - Jinja2 templating\\n  - Server action integration\\n\\n---\\n\\n## J. Modul Pembelajaran \\u0026 Survei\\n\\n### 34. `church_elearning` — Church eLearning\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Integrasi eLearning Odoo dengan portal GKI.ONE\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - API daftar courses\\n  - API konten slides\\n  - Security rules untuk portal users\\n- **Depends**: `website_slides`, `church_base`\\n\\n### 35. `church_management_survey` — Survey\\n- **Deskripsi**: Integrasi survey Odoo untuk keperluan gereja\\n\\n### 36. `church_management_teleios` — Teleios\\n- **Deskripsi**: Program pembinaan Teleios (program pertumbuhan rohani)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## K. Modul Integrasi \\u0026 Tools\\n\\n### 37. `church_immich` — Integrasi Immich - Face Matching\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Integrasi dengan Immich Photo Gallery\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Sinkronisasi data People dari Immich\\n  - Pencocokan wajah anggota jemaat\\n  - Menampilkan foto terkait dari galeri\\n  - Cron job sync otomatis\\n  - Face match wizard\\n\\n### 38. `church_ar` — Augmented Reality\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: AR content management untuk buku fisik\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - AR content set management\\n  - AR content items\\n\\n### 39. `church_forms` — Church Forms - Workflow\\n- **Versi**: 16.0.1.0.0\\n- **Deskripsi**: Form builder untuk keperluan gereja\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Form publikasi\\n  - Form keuangan\\n  - Form fund request\\n\\n### 40. `church_management_stats` — Stats\\n- **Deskripsi**: Statistik jemaat\\n\\n### 41. `church_debranding` — Church Debranding\\n- **Deskripsi**: Mengganti branding Odoo menjadi branding GKI\\n\\n### 42. `web_window_title` — Web Window Title\\n- **Deskripsi**: Custom window title untuk browser tab\\n\\n### 43. `odoo_mcp` — Odoo MCP Server\\n- **Deskripsi**: Model Context Protocol server untuk AI-assisted development\\n\\n---\\n\\n## L. Modul Partner \\u0026 Data\\n\\n### 44. `isf_partner` — Partner Management - Indonesian Address\\n- **Deskripsi**: Ekstensi alamat Indonesia (provinsi, kota, kecamatan, kelurahan)\\n\\n### 45. `isf_partner_data_id` — Partner Data - Indonesia\\n- **Deskripsi**: Data Indonesia (kode pos, wilayah administratif)\\n\\n### 46. `isf_user_mapping_secondary` — User Mapping Secondary\\n- **Deskripsi**: Mapping user ke multiple accounts\\n\\n### 47. `isf_contact_merge` — Contact \\u0026 User Merge\\n- **Deskripsi**: Penggabungan duplikat kontak\\n- **Fitur**:\\n  - Scan duplikat by email, phone, atau name\\n  - Merge wizard\\n\\n### 48. `scripts/` — Utility Scripts\\n- **Deskripsi**: Migration scripts dan utilities\\n\",\"Description\":\"Complete catalog of all 48 Odoo 16 backend modules with features and dependencies\",\"IsArtifact\":false,\"Overwrite\":false,\"TargetFile\":\"/Volumes/980PRO/OpenERP/addons/church-management-system/docs/02-modul-backend-odoo16.md\"}"
}

viewFile.content:
"use client";

import { useEffect, useState } from "react";
import { useJemaat } from "@/contexts/JemaatContext";
import Link from "next/link";
import { ChurchAsset, ChurchAssetCategory, AssetCondition, AssetStatus } from "@/types/odoo";
import { SyncToPurjDialog } from "@/components/SyncToPurjDialog";

const CONDITION_LABELS: Record<AssetCondition, { label: string; color: string }> = {
    baik: { label: "Baik", color: "bg-green-100 text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-400" },
    cukup: { label: "Cukup", color: "bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-400" },
    rusak_ringan: { label: "Rusak Ringan", color: "bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-400" },
    rusak_berat: { label: "Rusak Berat", color: "bg-red-100 text-red-800 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-400" },
};

const STATUS_LABELS: Record<AssetStatus, { label: string; color: string }> = {
    active: { label: "Aktif", color: "bg-green-100 text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-400" },
    maintenance: { label: "Dalam Perbaikan", color: "bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-900/30 dark:text-orange-400" },
    disposed: { label: "Dihapuskan", color: "bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900/30 dark:text-gray-400" },
};

interface AssetStats {
    total: number;
    byCondition: Record<AssetCondition, number>;
    byStatus: Record<AssetStatus, number>;
}

export default function AssetsPage() {
    const { selectedJemaatId, selectedJemaat } = useJemaat();
    const [assets, setAssets] = useState<ChurchAsset[]>([]);
    const [categories, setCategories] = useState<ChurchAssetCategory[]>([]);
    const [stats, setStats] = useState<AssetStats | null>(null);
    const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
    const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);

    // Filters
    const [search, setSearch] = useState("");
    const [categoryFilter, setCategoryFilter] = useState<string>("");
    const [conditionFilter, setConditionFilter] = useState<string>("");

    // Sync to PURJ dialog
    const [showSyncDialog, setShowSyncDialog] = useState(false);
    const [syncSuccess, setSyncSuccess] = useState(false);
    const [statusFilter, setStatusFilter] = useState<string>("");

    useEffect(() => {
        if (selectedJemaatId) {
            fetchCategories();
            fetchAssets();
        }
        // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps
    }, [selectedJemaatId]);

    useEffect(() => {
        if (selectedJemaatId) {
            const timer = setTimeout(() => {
                fetchAssets();
            }, 300);
            return () => clearTimeout(timer);
        }
        // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps
    }, [search, categoryFilter, conditionFilter, statusFilter]);

    const fetchCategories = async () => {
        try {
            const response = await fetch("/api/assets/categories");
            const data = await response.json();
            if (data.success) {
                setCategories(data.categories);
            }
        } catch (err) {
            console.error("Error fetching categories:", err);
        }
    };

    const fetchAssets = async () => {
        if (!selectedJemaatId) return;

        setLoading(true);
        try {
            const params = new URLSearchParams({ jemaatId: selectedJemaatId.toString() });
            if (search) params.append("search", search);
            if (categoryFilter) params.append("categoryId", categoryFilter);
            if (conditionFilter) params.append("condition", conditionFilter);
            if (statusFilter) params.append("status", statusFilter);

            const response = await fetch(`/api/assets?${params}`);
            const data = await response.json();

            if (data.success) {
                setAssets(data.assets);
                setStats(data.stats);
                setError(null);
            } else {
                setError(data.error || "Gagal memuat data aset");
            }
        } catch (err) {
            console.error("Error fetching assets:", err);
            setError("Gagal memuat data aset");
        } finally {
            setLoading(false);
        }
    };

    const formatCurrency = (value: number) => {
        return new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID', {
            style: 'currency',
            currency: 'IDR',
            minimumFractionDigits: 0,
            maximumFractionDigits: 0
        }).format(value);
    };

    if (!selectedJemaatId) {
        return (
            <div className="flex items-center justify-center h-64">
                <p className="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Silakan pilih jemaat terlebih dahulu</p>
            </div>
        );
    }

    return (
        <div className="space-y-6">
            {/* Header */}
            <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Aset {selectedJemaat?.name}</h1>
                    <p className="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Kelola aset-aset gereja</p>
                </div>
                <div className="flex gap-2">
                    <button
                        onClick={() => setShowSyncDialog(true)}
                        className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors"
                        title="Kirim data aset ke PURJ B1"
                    >
                        <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12" />
                        </svg>
                        Kirim ke PURJ
                    </button>
                    <Link
                        href="/assets/new"
                        className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-gki-blue hover:bg-gki-blue/90 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors"
                    >
                        <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" />
                        </svg>
                        Tambah Aset
                    </Link>
                </div>
            </div>

            {/* Success message */}
            {syncSuccess && (
                <div className="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 p-4 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                    Data aset berhasil dikirim ke PURJ B1!
                    <button onClick={() => setSyncSuccess(false)} className="ml-auto text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 hover:opacity-70">
                        <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            )}

            {/* Stats Cards */}
            {stats && (
                <div className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700">
                        <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Total Aset</p>
                        <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{stats.total}</p>
                    </div>
                    <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700">
                        <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Kondisi Baik</p>
                        <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">{stats.byCondition.baik}</p>
                    </div>
                    <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700">
                        <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Perlu Perhatian</p>
                        <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-600">{stats.byCondition.rusak_ringan + stats.byCondition.rusak_berat}</p>
                    </div>
                    <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700">
                        <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Dalam Perbaikan</p>
                        <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-600">{stats.byStatus.maintenance}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            )}

            {/* Filters */}
            <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700">
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    {/* Search */}
                    <div className="relative">
                        <input
                            type="text"
                            placeholder="Cari nama/kode aset..."
                            value={search}
                            onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}
                            className="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gki-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gki-blue"
                        />
                        <svg className="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 text-gray-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>

                    {/* Category Filter */}
                    <select
                        value={categoryFilter}
                        onChange={(e) => setCategoryFilter(e.target.value)}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gki-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gki-blue"
                    >
                        <option value="">Semua Kategori</option>
                        {categories.map((cat) => (
                            <option key={cat.id} value={cat.id}>{cat.name}</option>
                        ))}
                    </select>

                    {/* Condition Filter */}
                    <select
                        value={conditionFilter}
                        onChange={(e) => setConditionFilter(e.target.value)}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gki-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gki-blue"
                    >
                        <option value="">Semua Kondisi</option>
                        {Object.entries(CONDITION_LABELS).map(([key, { label }]) => (
                            <option key={key} value={key}>{label}</option>
                        ))}
                    </select>

                    {/* Status Filter */}
                    <select
                        value={statusFilter}
                        onChange={(e) => setStatusFilter(e.target.value)}
                        className="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gki-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gki-blue"
                    >
                        <option value="">Semua Status</option>
                        {Object.entries(STATUS_LABELS).map(([key, { label }]) => (
                            <option key={key} value={key}>{label}</option>
                        ))}
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            {/* Asset List */}
            {loading ? (
                <div className="flex items-center justify-center h-64">
                    <div className="animate-spin rounded-full h-8 w-8 border-b-2 border-gki-blue"></div>
                </div>
            ) : error ? (
                <div className="bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800 text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 rounded-xl p-4">
                    {error}
                </div>
            ) : assets.length === 0 ? (
                <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl p-12 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700 text-center">
                    <svg className="w-16 h-16 mx-auto text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={1.5} d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
                    </svg>
                    <h3 className="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Belum ada aset</h3>
                    <p className="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">Mulai dengan menambahkan aset pertama</p>
                    <Link
                        href="/assets/new"
                        className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-gki-blue hover:bg-gki-blue/90 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors"
                    >
                        <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={2} d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" />
                        </svg>
                        Tambah Aset
                    </Link>
                </div>
            ) : (
                <div className="bg-white dark:bg-gki-gray-800 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gki-gray-700 overflow-hidden">
                    <div className="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table className="w-full">
                            <thead className="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gki-gray-700">
                                <tr>
                                    <th className="px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider w-16">Foto</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Kode</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Nama Aset</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Kategori</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Kondisi</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Status</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-right text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Nilai</th>
                                    <th className="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider"></th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody className="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gki-gray-700">
                                {assets.map((asset) => (
                                    <tr key={asset.id} className="hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gki-gray-700/50">
                                        <td className="px-4 py-3">
                                            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gki-gray-600 flex items-center justify-center">
                                                {asset.image_preview ? (
                                                    <img
                                                        src={`data:image/png;base64,${asset.image_preview}`}
                                                        alt={asset.name}
                                                        className="w-full h-full object-cover"
                                                    />
                                                ) : (
                                                    <svg className="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                                        <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth={1.5} d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                                                    </svg>
                                                )}
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap">
                                            <span className="text-sm font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{asset.code}</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4">
                                            <div>
                                                <p className="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{asset.name}</p>
                                                {asset.location && (
                                                    <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">📍 {asset.location}</p>
                                                )}
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap">
                                            <span className="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                                {asset.category_id ? asset.category_id[1] : '-'}
                                            </span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap">
                                            <span className={`inline-flex px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full ${CONDITION_LABELS[asset.condition].color}`}>
                                                {CONDITION_LABELS[asset.condition].label}
                                            </span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap">
                                            <span className={`inline-flex px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full ${STATUS_LABELS[asset.status].color}`}>
                                                {STATUS_LABELS[asset.status].label}
                                            </span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-right">
                                            <span className="text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                                                {asset.original_value > 0 ? formatCurrency(asset.original_value) : '-'}
                                            </span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td className="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-right">
                                            <Link
                                                href={`/assets/${asset.id}`}
                                                className="text-gki-blue hover:text-gki-blue/80 text-sm font-medium"
                                            >
                                                Detail →
                                            </Link>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                ))}
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            )}

            {/* Sync to PURJ Dialog */}
            <SyncToPurjDialog
                isOpen={showSyncDialog}
                onClose={() => setShowSyncDialog(false)}
                jemaatId={selectedJemaatId || 0}
                onSuccess={() => {
                    setSyncSuccess(true);
                    setTimeout(() => setSyncSuccess(false), 5000);
                }}
            />
        </div>
    );
}

